{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31089","headline":"长安送友人之黔南 · 薛能","name":"长安送友人之黔南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衡岳犹云过，君家独几千。\n心从贱游话，分向禁城偏。\n陆路终何处，三湘在素船。\n琴书去迢递，星路照潺湲。\n台镜簪秋晚，盘蔬饭雨天。\n同文到乡尽，殊国共行连。\n後会应多日，归程自一年。\n贫交永无忘，孤进合相怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}